  "video_id": "Cjgbi5Dh-kg",
  "title": "Claude struggles with PDFs; Markitdown cuts tokens and boosts accuracy #claudeai #markitdown #aitech",
  "description": "Claude wastes thousands of tokens when processing PDFs due to broken formatting and unreadable content. The free tool Markitdown, with over 128,000 GitHub stars, converts PDFs, Word docs, PowerPoints, and Excel sheets into clean Markdown, a format Claude natively understands, resulting in up to 70% fewer tokens used and sharper responses.\n\nMarkitdown integrates seamlessly with Claude Desktop via an MCP server, automatically converting files for more efficient and accurate AI interactions. This improves usability and cost-effectiveness for users relying on Claude for document analysis and question answering.\n\nBy adopting Markitdown, users benefit from optimized token consumption and enhanced accuracy, highlighting the importance of proper input formatting in AI-driven workflows.\n\n#ClaudeAI #Markitdown #AItokenOptimization #PDFconversion #Markdown #MicrosoftSolutions #ClaudeDesktop #AIworkflow #GitHubTools #DocumentProcessing #AIefficiency #TokenSavings #AImodels #DataFormatting #ArtificialIntelligence",
